 serviceLabel:'Different paths. A shared starting point.',serviceTitle:'Where are you on your journey?',serviceIntro:'From vocational training to a new professional role, let’s explore the path that fits your background.',details:'Explore this path',services:[['Vocational training in Germany','Looking to learn a profession and enter the job market? Start with the training route and its requirements.','We begin by reviewing your chosen field, education, language level and documents. Application preparation and follow-up depend on the agreed scope of services. Admission decisions rest with the employer.'],['Recruitment for professionals','Ready for a new opportunity? Let’s understand where your experience and skills fit.','Relevant experience, technical skills, languages and credentials are reviewed for each route. Destinations and roles are identified after assessment. Profile introductions do not guarantee interviews or employment.'],['CV & interview preparation','Help your experience come across clearly, in your application and in conversation.','CVs and cover letters reflect your real experience, supporting evidence and career goal. Interview sessions and revision rounds are agreed before work starts.']],selectRoute:'Choose this path',
