 faqLabel:'Clarity before commitment',faqTitle:'You probably have a few questions.',faq:[['Where do I start?','We start with your goals, education, experience and languages. An assessment helps identify suitable services. It does not guarantee a result.'],['What language level do I need?','Requirements depend on the country, profession and employer. Language levels and certificates must be checked for each role.'],['What do the services cost?','Specialist services are paid. Scope, fees, payment milestones, cancellation terms and excluded costs are specified before agreement. Verified fees have not yet been added to this preview.'],['How long does the process take?','Document and language readiness, employer capacity and administrative procedures affect the timeline. We do not promise a fixed time or outcome without reviewing the case.'],['How can I track my request?','Tracking instructions will be provided when applications are enabled. This preview sends no application data and issues no real tracking number.']],
