 modal:{costs:['Clear services. Clear fees.','We assess your circumstances before specifying the service scope, fees, payment schedule, cancellation terms and costs outside the contract. Specialist services are paid. Verified fees have not yet been added to this preview.'],privacy:['Privacy in this preview','Form details and CV files are not sent to a server or saved in your browser. Only your language preference may be remembered. A complete policy covering processing, sharing, retention and deletion will be added before applications are enabled.'],terms:['Terms of use','This page is an initial service introduction. Assessment does not constitute case acceptance or guarantee employment or a visa. Final services are agreed after review. This preview does not receive real applications.'],complaint:['Enquiry or complaint','Official contact details and the person responsible for responding will be added after verification of the Tehran office details. This preview does not receive requests.'],employer:['Tell us what your team needs','The final form will request company name, website, hiring contact, role, headcount, location, language and intended start date. Employer enquiries are not yet enabled in this preview.']}
